fixture zone1_04_hidden_route
doc BUILD.md s5 tech 4 "Pogo-dash reset: pogo resets the air dash, so pogo, dash, pogo again crosses anything. Taught by a hidden room"; s5 Pogo "Resets: Double jump, air dash"; s15 "Pogo resets air dash; pogo, dash, pogo crosses the reference hidden-room gap"; s3 "hidden rooms reachable only with movement tech"; zone 1 room 4's teaching route, west door to the hidden alcove to the east door
room zone1/04_pogo_dash_reset
spawn 74 2336
frames 550
input
  # Dashing along the floor to the tower; a jump and the air jump beside post 1 and a down-strike
  # onto it; then on each bounce the same rhythm: the air jump at the bounce's top, the up-dash at
  # the air jump's top (beside the next post, clear of its spikes), over the next post and the
  # down-strike as the feet come to it. From post 4 the same rhythm carries into the alcove; its
  # floor's hole drops down the chute and through the east door.
  0 R !dash
  1..24 R
  25 R !dash
  26..49 R
  50 R !dash
  51..98 R
  103..123 jump
  125..139 jump
  140..143 R jump
  144 R
